                  <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="M16.5 16.5L21 21"></path></svg>
                  Buscar incidente, cámara, ruta…
